{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "7c1e2a4b-3d5f-4a6e-9b8c-1f2e3d4c5b6a",
    "name": "Calendar Event Microservice",
    "description": "Colección de la API del microservicio de calendario.\n\nAntes de correr:\n1. Elige el environment **Local** o **CloudRun**.\n2. Llena `userId`, `otherUserId` (un segundo usuario distinto, para probar 403) y `petId` (una mascota existente) en el environment.\n3. Las fechas (`startDate`, `endDate`, `reminderAt`) se generan automáticamente en cada request (siempre futuras).\n4. Los IDs de los eventos creados (`userEventId`, `petEventId`) se guardan solos en el environment al crear eventos.\n\nLa carpeta *Crear* debe correr antes que *Listar* y *Actualizar y eliminar*. Se puede correr toda la colección con el Collection Runner en orden.\n\nNo hay autenticación: el `userId` viaja en body o query.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [],
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "const now = Date.now();",
          "const DAY = 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000;",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('startDate', new Date(now + 7 * DAY).toISOString());",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('endDate', new Date(now + 7 * DAY + 60 * 60 * 1000).toISOString());",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('reminderAt', new Date(now + 6 * DAY).toISOString());"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Crear",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Crear evento de usuario (201)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.test('Sin petId => calendario de usuario', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().pet_id).to.be.null);",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) { pm.environment.set('userEventId', pm.response.json().id); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"userId\": \"{{userId}}\",\n  \"title\": \"Recordatorio general\",\n  \"description\": \"Evento de calendario de usuario\",\n  \"eventType\": \"OTHER\",\n  \"startDate\": \"{{startDate}}\",\n  \"endDate\": \"{{endDate}}\",\n  \"location\": \"Casa\",\n  \"reminderAt\": \"{{reminderAt}}\",\n  \"reminderEnabled\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/calendar-events",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["calendar-events"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Crear evento de mascota (201)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.test('Con petId => calendario de mascota', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().pet_id).to.eql(pm.environment.get('petId')));",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) { pm.environment.set('petEventId', pm.response.json().id); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"userId\": \"{{userId}}\",\n  \"petId\": \"{{petId}}\",\n  \"title\": \"Cita veterinaria\",\n  \"description\": \"Vacuna anual\",\n  \"eventType\": \"VET_APPOINTMENT\",\n  \"startDate\": \"{{startDate}}\",\n  \"endDate\": \"{{endDate}}\",\n  \"location\": \"Clínica Veterinaria Central\",\n  \"reminderAt\": \"{{reminderAt}}\",\n  \"reminderEnabled\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/calendar-events",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["calendar-events"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Crear sin userId (401)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 401 - userId obligatorio en body', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Sin dueño\",\n  \"eventType\": \"OTHER\",\n  \"startDate\": \"{{startDate}}\",\n  \"endDate\": \"{{endDate}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/calendar-events",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["calendar-events"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Crear con tipo inválido (400)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 400 - eventType inválido', () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"userId\": \"{{userId}}\",\n  \"title\": \"Tipo inválido\",\n  \"eventType\": \"NO_EXISTE\",\n  \"startDate\": \"{{startDate}}\",\n  \"endDate\": \"{{endDate}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/calendar-events",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["calendar-events"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Crear con endDate anterior a startDate (400)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 400 - endDate < startDate', () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));",
                  "pm.test('Mensaje de error de fechas', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().error).to.eql('End date cannot be before start date'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"userId\": \"{{userId}}\",\n  \"title\": \"Fechas invertidas\",\n  \"eventType\": \"OTHER\",\n  \"startDate\": \"{{endDate}}\",\n  \"endDate\": \"{{startDate}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/calendar-events",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["calendar-events"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Crear sin campos obligatorios (400)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 400 - faltan campos', () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"userId\": \"{{userId}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/calendar-events",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["calendar-events"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Listar",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar todos los eventos del usuario",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Respuesta con arreglo events', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().events).to.be.an('array'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/calendar-events?userId={{userId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["calendar-events"],
              "query": [{ "key": "userId", "value": "{{userId}}" }]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar calendario de usuario (calendarType=user)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Solo eventos sin mascota', () => pm.response.json().events.forEach(e => pm.expect(e.pet_id).to.be.null));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/calendar-events?userId={{userId}}&calendarType=user",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["calendar-events"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "userId", "value": "{{userId}}" },
                { "key": "calendarType", "value": "user" }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar calendario de mascotas (calendarType=pet)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
